{"resourceIdentifier":"4338","resourceName":"Bishuiyuan Wastewater Treatment Plant Project","description":"Bishuiyuan wastewater treatment plant project is located in Xinjiang Province, China(hereafter referred to as the project) introduces aerobic wastewater treatment plant to treat wastewaterfrom towns in many regions of Xinjiang Province, there are 11 wastewater plants, each using the same treatment process (A2O+MBR). The project owner is Xinjiang Bishuiyuan Environmental Resources Co., Ltd. The whole aerobic process includes pre-treatment process,secondary biological treatment process, tertiary deep treatment process and sludge treatment process, with an maximum design influent flow of 515,000 m3/d, and the influent COD concentrations of all wastewater treatment plants are shown in the following table. The wastewater is composed of industrial wastewater and part of domestic wastewater within the\r\nservice area. The project reduce environmental pollution and destroy methane emissions from the open anaerobic lagoons in baseline scenario, the best available low-cost solution forwastewater treatment.\r\nEmission reductions of this project are generated by reducing methane emissions of the openanaerobic lagoons in baseline scenario. The first wastewater treatment plant began construction on 28/06/2020, and it was officially put into operation on 5/12/2021, and the last one began construction on 05/7/2020, and it was officially put into operation on 25/12/2021. Annual average estimation of GHG emission reductions from the project activity is 167,014 tCO2e/year, the total GHG emission reductions during the first 10-year crediting period are estimated to be 1,670,140 tCO2e","location":{"latitude":44.024720,"longitude":87.663054},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-05-20","endExclusive":"2023-06-20","endInclusive":"2023-06-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4338"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVI